      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i've already been doing a lot of research online and most people in the biohacking community say that just waiting for a doctor's appointment takes forever. i don't think my iron is actually \"low,\" i just want to optimize it to the top of the range for peak performance. like, if i wanted to be aggressive with it, what's a daily dose that would definitely move the needle? i'm willing to take a lot if it means i stop feeling so tired.",
